@req:1106934:req@
Combo Point Finishers have a 10% chance per combo point to reduce all damage taken by 8% for 12 seconds.

Riposte hits an additional target and dodging any attack has a 25% chance to allow the use of Riposte.

@req:1106934:req@
Combo Point Finishers have a 20% chance per combo point to reduce all damage taken by 8% for 12 seconds.

Riposte hits 2 additional targets and dodging any attack has a 50% chance to allow the use of Riposte.
